      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If her raw technical assessment data is \"basically perfect,\" that is a powerful indicator of high capability in problem-solving, regardless of the source of her knowledge. You are right to question the hidden potential for abstract reasoning, but a high test score suggests strong aptitude, not just routine execution. I would advise using the high assessment data as a strong claim and then specifically targeting challenging, abstract design problems in the interview to test that foundational depth directly.",
